msgid "Starts an Ampere A1 server with 1 core and 6 GB of memory, half the Always Free allowance, retrying when Oracle has no free capacity"
msgstr "Spustí server Ampere A1 s 1 jádrem a 6 GB paměti, tedy polovinou limitu Always Free; pokud Oracle nemá volnou kapacitu, pokusy opakuje"

#~ msgid "Installs Folding@home on a nightly schedule if you asked for it above"
#~ msgstr "Installs Folding@home on a nightly schedule if you asked for it above"

