#. 0: lookbackSentence(status.historyDays)
#: src/routes/(authenticated)/settings/connectors/google-health/google-health-page.svelte
msgid "A date requests a one-time import of older data shared with Google Health, back to that day. Choose an earlier date and save to request more history. The field clears once the requested history is complete. {0} Automatic sync does not re-import that period each time, and an empty field does not remove older records. Empty results are not errors. To pause imports, clear all selections and save. Data that was already imported is kept."
